flowchart LR
  SOURCE[Approved data sources] --> MANIFEST[Provenance + data card]
  MANIFEST --> PREP[Future preprocessing]
  PREP --> CONFIG[Versioned experiment config]
  CONFIG --> JOB[Isolated training job]
  JOB --> CKPT[Quarantined checkpoints]
  CKPT --> EVAL[Evaluation + safety review]
  EVAL --> RELEASE[Reviewed artifact release]
  AUDIT[License, privacy, security gate] -. gate .-> MANIFEST
